  "contract": [
    "Judgement of The Three Hammers (280210) is a self-cast 15 second buff (120s cooldown) with a native",
    "SPELL_AURA_PROC_TRIGGER_SPELL aura carrying raw DBC ProcChance 20 and ProcFlags 0. Without a spell_proc",
    "row the aura never procs (Aura::GetProcEffectMask always returns 0), regardless of how much damage is",
    "dealt while it is active. Six independent 15 second windows of ordinary 1900ms sword swings (about",
    "seven to eight swings per window, roughly forty-eight total) at a 20% chance give the proc about",
    "0.0023% odds of never firing once; before the fix it never fires regardless of sample size."
